"Runs wp core install via WP-CLI to create all WordPress tables, set the site"
" URL, title, and admin account."
msgstr ""
"Executa wp core install via WP-CLI para criar todas as tabelas do WordPress "
"e definir a URL, o título e a conta de administrador do site."

